	//
	// ⚠ APPENDED PAST THE END OF THE UNION (`osExit` was the last variant), which is the band-append
	// invariant working in the reviewer's favour: every stale `… to osExit` / `branch to osAllocPages`
	// full-tail range arm now FAILS TO COMPILE until it is consciously extended. The `category` metadata
	// places each variant logically (a `memory`-band `funcAddr`, a `call`-band `callIndirect`)
	// independently of this tail position.
	//
	// The RIP-relative ADDRESS of a named function — the `.text` twin of `globalAddr` (`.data`) and
	// `rdataAddr` (`.rdata`): identical operand shape (a `funcName` NAME, one plain def, no value use) and
	// identical metadata (`isPure: true` — it recomputes an address that cannot change, freely
	// rematerializable; `isMemory: false` — a `lea` touches no memory). They are distinct ops rather than
